               <t:note>
                  <t:date type="foundation" notBefore="1400" notAfter="1500">1400-1500</t:date>
                  <t:desc type="foundation">The old church is said to have been founded by King Zarʾā Yāʿqob (r. <t:date>1438-1468</t:date>); the monastic community was established by <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10378Yohanne">King Yoḥannǝs IV</t:persName> (r. <t:date>1872-1889</t:date>). The religious site might have existed in the Aksumite time.</t:desc>
                  <t:ab type="history">Gadām. The monastic community consists of at least 15 monks. 
</t:ab>
                  <t:ab type="description">
                     <t:figure>
                        <t:graphic url="Sites/QDGM.tif">
                           <t:desc>The church photographed by Denis Nosnitsin during the Ethio-SPaRe project.</t:desc>
                        </t:graphic>
                     </t:figure>13 Mss. photographed: <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm001">QDGM-001</t:ref> ʺThe Four Gospelsʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm002">QDGM-002</t:ref> ʺPraise of Godʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm003">QDGM-003</t:ref> ʺOctateuchʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm004">QDGM-004</t:ref> ʺPsalterʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm005">QDGM-005</t:ref> ʺPraise of Godʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm006">QDGM-006</t:ref> ʺThe Harp of Praiseʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm007">QDGM-007</t:ref> ʺFour Gospelsʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm008">QDGM-008</t:ref> ʺThe Book of the Spirtual Elderʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm009">QDGM-009</t:ref> ʺCommentary to the Pauline Epistlesʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm010">QDGM-010</t:ref> ʺThe History of the Apostlesʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm011">QDGM-011</t:ref> ʺPsalterʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm012">QDGM-012</t:ref> ʺVita of ʾArägawiʺ; <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESqdgm013">QDGM-013</t:ref> ʺVita of Kirosʺ. The collection includes more than 120 Mss.</t:ab>
                
                  <t:ab type="tabot">
                     <t:measure quantity="7"/>Tābots of <t:persName type="tabot" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS6819Mary">Mary</t:persName>, <t:persName type="tabot" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS5684JesusCh#n3MadhaneAlam">Madḫāne ʿĀlam</t:persName>, <t:persName type="tabot" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS4585Georgeo">George</t:persName>, 
                     <t:persName type="tabot" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10581Zamika">ʾAragāwi</t:persName>, <t:persName type="tabot" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS10775Trinity">Trinity</t:persName>, <t:ref type="authFile" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/CovenantMercy">Kidāna Mǝḥrat</t:ref>, 
                     probably <t:persName type="tabot" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9162TaklaHa">Takla Haymanot</t:persName>.</t:ab>
